# skills: Blinding Gale (blind on every enemy), skipping one that already has a status: battler 5 is
# poisoned by a poke first. Gabryel alone at level 39 (level index 38 pinned, battle MP pinned to 50), first temple battle
# (back row 4, 5, 6; front row 9, 10). On the Special list Right reaches the skill (in Blinding Swipe's place) (shot
# bg_list); A casts with no picker: her pose, then a green ring on each enemy (shots bg_a to
# bg_i), MP 50 -> 40 once, and the status of the others goes 0 -> 2 while battler 5 keeps its 6 and gets no ring. Next round A on it is refused with "No
# effect!" (bg_refused): every enemy has a status. Battle records at 0x0228E860 (0x6C each: status in the low nibble of +0x08, HP +0x14, MP +0x18).
# Run with --save.
include party_gabryel
pin u32 0x020B471C 38
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x18 50
wait 270
poke u8 0x0228ea84 6
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
watch u32 0x0228e878 gabryel_mp
watch u8 0x0228ea18 status4
watch u8 0x0228ea84 status5
watch u8 0x0228eaf0 status6
watch u8 0x0228ebc8 status8
watch u8 0x0228ec34 status9
watch u8 0x0228eca0 status10
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
shot bg_list
press A 8
wait 30
wait 210
wait 30
shot bg_a
wait 30
shot bg_b
wait 30
shot bg_c
wait 30
shot bg_d
wait 30
shot bg_e
wait 30
shot bg_f
wait 30
shot bg_g
wait 30
shot bg_h
wait 30
shot bg_i
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 110
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 30
shot bg_refused
wait 100
shot bg_after
